   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Modal verbs",
     "texto": [
      "**Können** (can, to know how to), **wollen** (to want), **müssen** (to have to) and **dürfen** (to be allowed to) are irregular in the singular, and the forms for **ich** and **er** are the same, with no ending.",
      "Their feature: the other verb goes in the infinitive **at the end** of the sentence. **Ich kann Auto fahren** (I can drive; literally «I can car drive»). **Ich muss heute arbeiten** (I have to work today)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
