    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Knowing how and being able: the same verb",
     "texto": [
      "In German, **können** is used both for a skill (**Ich kann schwimmen**, I can swim) and for a possibility or a favour (**Kannst du mir helfen?**, can you help me?).",
      "The negation goes before the infinitive: **Ich kann nicht schwimmen**.",
      "To ask for permission, **dürfen** is used: **Darf ich das Fenster öffnen?** (may I open the window?)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
